      "1": "Outdated exemptions for first-time adopters of IFRS are removed effective for annual periods beginning on or after 1 January 2018. The adoption of these changes will not have an impact on the financial statements of the Group and Company since the Group and Comapny is not a first time adopter of IFRS."
